# PRIVATE (미방송분). Tracking tear when caught (JS3): torn bands, no red, one flash only; the safe mode uses a still noise.
@palette ../palette/ui.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../fx/mbs_fx_tear.png
@preview ../previews/mbs_fx_tear_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame tear
